| absent | explicit supported dtype | explicit dtype | Validate backend and hardware first |
| unknown/malformed | any | configuration error | Fix or replace checkpoint metadata |

Hardware gates: FP8 KV cache is validated for H100/SM90 and B200/GB200-class
SM100+ pools. A100/SM80 and earlier pools must not receive this checkpoint-led
FP8 rollout until their selected backend has separate validation. NVFP4 is
restricted to the validated SM100 execution path. These gates are deployment
policy in addition to vLLM's own backend checks.

## Deployment precheck

- Pin the model/checkpoint digest, vLLM build, attention backend, GPU SKU,
  compute capability, driver hash, and resolved KV-cache dtype in the change
  record.
- Inspect checkpoint `quantization_config`, including nested `quantization`,
  `kv_cache_scheme`, and `kv_cache_quant_algo`. Run configuration creation on
  CPU and record the resolved dtype or actionable rejection.
- Reject pools outside the compatibility matrix. Confirm CI is green, nodes
  are ready, the fallback profile is set, and capacity/cache-memory headroom is
  at least 15%.
- Run GPU smoke and quality/perplexity comparison on the exact checkpoint,
  backend, and hardware tuple. Include prefix-cache, eager/graph, and representative
  context-length coverage.
- Record baseline p95/p99 latency, request errors, GPU OOMs, token throughput,
  cache hit/eviction rates, and output-quality metrics.

## Canary

Use the published standard stages, extending holds for quantization risk:

1. 1% for 30–60 minutes.
2. 5% for 60 minutes.
3. 25% for two hours.
4. 100% only after every gate remains healthy.","content_hash":"599a6949ad44807d281e51a7c4a5e31f84e3762c09a1c9b7c058eba9354b5bec","chunk_metadata":{"ordinal":1,"document_path":"/knowledge/runbooks/kv-cache-dtype-rollout.md","document_kind":"curated","workspace":"task/jamal-vllm-34752-20260816","team":""}}},"conflict_id":null,"change_id":"qdrant:ee2ff535096fb2519125c870"},{"table":"knowledge","key":{"id":"workspace_101071d82d702ddff3249333:00002"},"change":"added","before":null,"after":{"id":"workspace_101071d82d702ddff3249333:00002","vector":{"bm25":{"indices":[19522071,24404605,33140797,103762891,117822826,117848935,118939517,134468130,152217691,157013062,182765111,228353112,230369282,233592972,250826051,262962171,264653773,264741300,314885586,339478471,358389376,388471277,390626577,402167784,403465192,422208903,448220673,454222729,456196542,465629622,467061102,513900473,516830072,520427161,523529899,572399988,579782570,640124220,656810198,668707053,684900361,697303812,701299146,728165346,749129358,752368150,766055642,766710245,772165269,775275475,800816682,807351724,823588779,829318785,833440336,844835998,853122056,858981991,869433802,926244272,938486536,964658953,964907347,989134019,1000623976,1004164276,1024530264,1044307776,1050888320,1054955099,1055508231,1055677912,1069826093,1105706408,1108634416,1128922433,1131517175,1132748958,1144867018,1150483835,1172383616,1187133073,1187159329,1200021954,1208984991,1216217081,1231507413,1233897091,1234868792,1246280156,1252494161,1361779418,1394226660,1449660732,1459505690,1480150064,1515372845,1518651811,1519078073,1535067589,1539641452,1541169940,1576725579,1592603301,1595222916,1599503589,1607681220,1626531487,1645540475,1678348498,1706587157,1742836257,1746366895,1751311563,1763574823,1769708000,1795512456,1810453357,1838535212,1858260302,1866402814,1877954220,1909780703,1923621064,1963858067,1967170394,1981521477,2031875777,2040027169,2063350695,2071029670,2079000089,2114948387,2115951620,2128227386,2134303291,213