# KV-cache dtype rollout

Owner: Serving Infrastructure

## Validated precedence

Resolve KV-cache dtype before backend selection:

1. If a ModelOpt checkpoint contains a supported `kv_cache_quant_algo`, it is
   authoritative. An omitted `--kv-cache-dtype`, explicit `auto`, or an
   equivalent explicit dtype adopts that value.
2. A conflicting explicit dtype is rejected during configuration. The error
   identifies the requested and checkpoint dtypes and tells the operator to
   remove the flag, use `auto`, or use the checkpoint dtype.
3. Unsupported checkpoint metadata is rejected during configuration; it must
   never silently fall back to the model dtype.
4. Without checkpoint KV metadata, omitted/`auto` follows the model dtype and
   an explicit supported dtype is used as requested.

`fp8` and `fp8_e4m3` are equivalent for ModelOpt metadata. Current supported
checkpoint algorithms are `fp8` and `nvfp4`.

## Compatibility matrix

| Checkpoint metadata | Requested dtype | Resolution | Deployment disposition |
|---|---|---|---|
| `fp8` | omitted, `auto`, `fp8`, `fp8_e4m3` | `fp8_e4m3` | Canary on validated SM89+ pool |
| `fp8` | any conflicting dtype | configuration error | Do not deploy; use checkpoint-compatible config |
| `nvfp4` | omitted, `auto`, `nvfp4` | `nvfp4` | Canary only on validated SM100 path |
| `nvfp4` | any conflicting dtype | configuration error | Do not deploy |
| absent | omitted or `auto` | model dtype | Existing compatibility applies |
| absent | explicit supported dtype | explicit dtype | Validate backend and hardware first |
| unknown/malformed | any | configuration error | Fix or replace checkpoint metadata |","content_hash":"99081ec66e072bf3e67ada375a7cae355578f24e11ce465296d01c2fb475a1bd","chunk_metadata":{"ordinal":0,"document_path":"/knowledge/runbooks/kv-cache-dtype-rollout.md","document_kind":"curated","workspace":"task/jamal-vllm-34752-20260816","team":""}}},"conflict_id":null,"change_id":"qdrant:c0316e1bf726207d0f9d294c"},{"table":"knowledge","key":{"id":"workspace_101071d82d702ddff3249333:00001"},"change":"added","before":null,"after":{"id":"workspace_101071d82d702ddff3249333:00001","vector":{"bm25":{"indices":[3198288,11875599,19522071,21141582,33140797,34990909,86022670,106411261,114827827,117848935,118939517,131900689,136345932,144051554,152217691,158490405,175987825,182014134,182765111,211040482,216888295,230369282,243905464,248443073,250826051,264653773,264659253,264741300,308552111,336939528,358389376,362932159,377896724,388471277,390626577,403465192,448220673,454222729,456196542,465629622,482263480,489905694,504851561,516830072,572399988,573907699,575491131,579782570,588093802,638699477,640124220,661276429,668707053,672811249,684900361,697303812,716765060,737611954,744926997,749129358,752368150,761976698,766710245,768840796,772165269,775275475,800816682,824480995,829318785,833440336,833600358,844376589,844835998,844849131,849652357,869433802,917735973,926244272,929623069,938486536,945556152,964658953,989134019,1040411403,1054955099,1054993318,1055677912,1069826093,1074083062,1082867806,1108634416,1112303730,1120116319,1122756066,1126074772,1132748958,1144867018,1150483835,1164717190,1172383616,1176022733,1177157900,1187159329,1198703660,1204159234,1208614892,1216083976,1216217081,1233897091,1246280156,1252494161,1254444102,1275916244,1277427225,1283123381,1283721936,1295245089,1301487453,1311754625,1323337458,1328132910,1337579030,1394226660,1396868207,1419923336,1421428866,1422246227,1443829736,1449660732,1455707387,1480150064,1501976062,1511580802,1515372845,151865181